sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Caller
    participant A as Planner
    participant D as Discovery / MCP
    participant P as Policy Authority
    participant R as Host Executor
    participant S as State Authority
    participant E as Evidence Store
    U->>A: Goal and trusted caller context
    A->>D: Discover eligible versioned descriptors
    D-->>A: Descriptors, not authority grants
    loop Until approved or bounded revision budget exhausted
        A->>P: Proposed path, inputs, profiles, effects, budgets
        P->>P: Check grants, semantics, state, locality, quality
        alt Proposal denied
            P-->>A: Rejection and permitted remediation
            P->>E: Record rejected proposal and reason
        else Proposal approved
            P-->>A: Scoped approval, digest, expiry, policy revision
            P->>E: Record approved plan
        end
    end
    alt No valid approval
        A-->>U: Terminate or escalate without privileged effects
    else Valid approval exists
        A->>D: Invoke approved capability through exposed interface
        D->>R: Scoped invocation and approval identity
        R->>P: Recheck authority and freshness at effect boundary
        alt Approval stale or material plan change
            P-->>R: Reject and require reapproval
            R->>E: Record rejection without privileged effect
            R-->>D: Denied without privileged effect
            D-->>A: Approval invalid, require reapproval
            A-->>U: Denial or explicit escalation
        else Invocation remains permitted
            P-->>R: Permit bounded execution
            R->>R: Validate input, execute, validate output
            R->>S: Atomic transition or explicit effect protocol
            S-->>R: Committed, rejected, or effect status unknown
            R->>E: Record versions, output, effects, quality, correlation
            R-->>D: Explicit result or reconciliation requirement
            D-->>A: Result with allowed degradation and provenance
            A-->>U: Outcome and concise decision evidence
        end
    end
